Description: coding agent harness with a persistent Python control environment
 Prime Agent provides a terminal interface and session engine for coding
 agents, with a persistent Python runtime and bundled skills.
 The Python kernel environment is provisioned on first use using a
 separately installed uv executable, or a prepared Python environment.
